{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22217","headline":"游石门涧 · 白居易","name":"游石门涧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石门无旧径，披榛访遗迹。\n时逢山水秋，清辉如古昔。\n常闻慧远辈，题诗此岩壁。\n云覆莓苔封，苍然无处觅。\n萧疎野生竹，崩剥多年石。\n自从东晋後，无复人游历。\n独有秋涧声，潺湲空旦夕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}